      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ابدر</span></b>  <i>He had the full moon rising to him,</i> (S,
M, K,) or <i>upon him:</i> (A:) a verb similar to
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَقْمَرَ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَشْرَقَ</span>: (A:) or <i>he journeyed during a
night of full moon.</i> (T, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <i>It</i> (an unripe
date) <i>became red.</i> (TA.) [See also 1.] ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ابدر</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى المَالِ اليَتِيمِ</span>: see 3.

